  "reading": "せんさく",
  "romaji": "sensaku",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "turning (lathe machining)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "turning; lathe machining",
      "explanation": "Machining a rotating workpiece with a fixed cutting tool on a lathe ({旋盤|せんばん}). One of the main types of {切削|せっさく} (cutting), best suited to round parts. Takes する to form a verb."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29605_sensaku_ex1",
      "japanese": "{旋盤|せんばん}で{軸|じく}を{旋削|せんさく}する。",
      "english": "To turn a shaft on a lathe.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29605_sensaku_ex2",
      "japanese": "{旋削|せんさく}は{丸|まる}い{部品|ぶひん}を{作|つく}るのに{向|む}いている。",
      "english": "Turning is well suited to making round parts.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29605_sensaku_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{工場|こうじょう}では{金属|きんぞく}の{棒|ぼう}を{旋削|せんさく}して{部品|ぶひん}に{仕上|しあ}げる。",
      "english": "At this factory they turn metal rods on a lathe to finish them into parts.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Cutting a rotating workpiece with a fixed tool on a lathe; a type of {切削|せっさく}. Not to be confused with the homophone {詮索|せんさく} (prying).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {旋削|せんさく}{加工|かこう}: turning work\n- {旋盤|せんばん}で{旋削|せんさく}する: to turn on a lathe\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {切削|せっさく}: cutting; machining — the broader category\n- {旋盤|せんばん}: lathe — the machine used for turning",
